"def reference(vectors):\n    s=0\n    a=0\n    b=0\n    r=[]\n    for v in vectors:\n        if \"a\" in v:\n            a=int(v[\"a\"])&1\n        if \"b\" in v:\n            b=int(v[\"b\"])&1\n        old=s\n        s=(a&b)|(old&(a|b))\n        q=s^a^b\n        r.append({\"q\":q&1,\"state\":s&1})\n        if \"mid\" in v and v[\"mid\"] is not None:\n            m=v[\"mid\"]\n            if \"a\" in m:\n                a=int(m[\"a\"])&1\n            if \"b\" in m:\n                b=int(m[\"b\"])&1\n    return r\n"
